<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE - GDP, employment, wholesale.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE - GDP, employment, wholesale.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR	PERIOD	 PREVIOUS		  EXPECTED</p>
<p>					    DATA			DATE</p>
<p> GDP		   Q4, Yr 1996  Q3 +0.8, '95 +1.9 pct  Jan 9</p>
<p> Numbers in work   Oct	    Sept 34.5 million	    Jan 9</p>
<p> Wholesale sales   Nov	    Oct +0.7 pct	     Jan 10</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Statistics Office said the GDP and jobs data release times were firm, but the wholesale sales figure was a target.</p>
<p>The Federal Labour Office has already said that December unemployment figures would be released on January 9.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
